{
  "name": "rhino-preservation-v1",
  "description": "Contract for the future live adapter. Geometry cases pass only when their expected verdict is preserved on two identical measurements (including intentional negative fixtures). Model cases require fresh independently accepted models. Capture cases use fixed validate_capture predicates. The swapped reference must pass its own task; the equal-volume control must reject incorrect dimensions. All 43 verdicts are mandatory. This contract alone does not execute Rhino.",
